@startuml state-order
' Ekte Mat Online — state machine for Order.status (OB4 A3; US-12, US-15)
' States: OFFICIAL (OB4 A3). Which transitions are allowed beyond the main path: ASSUMPTION (OQ-04).
!pragma layout smetana
hide empty description

[*] --> submitted : customer submits order (C3)

submitted --> approved : admin approves
submitted --> rejected : admin rejects
approved --> in_preparation : admin starts preparation
in_preparation --> delivered : admin marks delivered

submitted --> cancelled : admin cancels
approved --> cancelled : admin cancels
in_preparation --> cancelled : admin cancels

delivered --> [*]
rejected --> [*]
cancelled --> [*]

note right of submitted
  Entry: paymentStatus = not_paid
end note

note bottom of cancelled
  delivered, rejected and cancelled are final:
  no further status change (US-15 AC3).
  Cancel from approved / in_preparation: ASSUMPTION.
end note

note right of approved
  Payment status (not_paid, deposit_paid, invoiced, paid)
  is set independently by the admin in any order state
  (OB4 A3 "e.g."; no rules given: ASSUMPTION, US-16).
end note
@enduml
